<title>USA: Dallas Cty, Texas, $3.6 mln won by Coastal Sec..</title>
<headline>Dallas Cty, Texas, $3.6 mln won by Coastal Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Securities said it won $3.6 million</p>
<p>of Dallas Cty, Texas, combination tax and revenue certificates of</p>
<p>obligation, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 4.6470 percent.</p>
